</figure>
<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">EZ-MIA’s TPR@1% collapses to near-zero on WikiText for most models despite achieving moderate-to-high AUC. LT-MIA maintains substantially higher TPR across all models, explaining why its advantage grows at stricter operating thresholds.</p>
</div>
</section>
